ion : name of particle
1 : charge of particle in units of elementary charge
5.48634767053312 : mass in dalton
2000 : number particles per thread
100000000000000.0 : average initial total density (m^-3)
0.01 : average initial temperature (eV)
2 : Initial factor of increase in particle array
0 : EEDF type (0 = maxwellian)
-4191.70271992157 : initial drift velocity in x-direction
1 3 : number coordinates in space and velocity
2 0.4 1.236 1 : dist type (0 uniform, 1 cosine, 2 sine), density alpha, drift alpha, match positions of previous species
ENDFILE
